<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20278" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βολή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>stroke</i> or <i>wound</i> of a missile (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληγή</span>, of sword or pike), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.283
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				24.161
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. πέτρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					59
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Ir.</u>
					p.31
				</span></i>
			 W. (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέχρι λίθου καὶ ἀκοντίου βολῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.65
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἔρωτος</span>”
				<i>shafts of love,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					AP
					12.160
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βολαῖς . . σφόγγος ὤλεσεν
			γραφήν</span> by its <i>stroke</i> or <i>touch</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1329
			</span></i>; <i>swing</i> of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλτῆρες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.34.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύβων βολαί</span>
			<i>throws</i> or <i>casts</i> of dicc, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				429
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ὀφθαλμῶν</span>
			<i>quick glances</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.150
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτω . . βλεμμάτων ῥέπει β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					242
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				2.27.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. κεραύνιοι</span>
			thunder-<i>bolts</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				430
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βολαὶ ἡλίου</span>
				sun-<i>beams</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				877
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1134
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοῦ . . βολαῖς</span>
			<i>with</i> golden <i>rays</i>, of a statue, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1026
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βολαὶ χιόνος</span>
			<i>radiance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				662
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ψυχὰς οἷον βολὰς εἶναι λέγουσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.4.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βολαί,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠδῖνες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				4.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<i>payment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδώσω ἐπὶ βολαῖς δυσίν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stud.Pal.</u>
					20.139
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
